# series charon: patch -p1 in charon/ of the upstream source
#
# charon: --hide-marker-traits hides the auto traits of the standard library
#
# Send, Sync, Unpin, Freeze, UnwindSafe and RefUnwindSafe join the hidden marker traits: their
# clauses, built-in impls (BuiltinOrAuto with Auto data, which Aeneas does not handle), supertrait
# clauses and explicit impls disappear. Auto traits have no items, so no information the
# translated code uses is lost. UI test hide-auto-traits.

